# Marketing copy review

Review of `marketing/launch-copy.md` against `product/spec.md`.

## Findings

| # | Copy claim | Spec says | Issue |
|---|-----------|-----------|-------|
| 1 | *Works offline, anywhere.* | `Offline support: removed in this release.` | Offline support explicitly removed — copy says it works. |
| 2 | *Export to CSV, PDF and Excel in one click.* | `Export: CSV only.` | Copy promises PDF and Excel; spec limits export to CSV. |

## Conclusion

Both substantive claims in the launch copy are unsupported by the current spec.
